    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      321.83,
      451.21,
      350.49
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 14 of the Immigrants and Emigrants Act(Chapter 351) and the legal effect of that clause is to increase the period of a visa and tomake provisions for the Minister to determine the period of permanent residence visa.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,BoldItalic",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      227.85,
      166.97,
      402.89,
      190.31
    ],
    "text": "1Immigrants and Emigrants(Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      203.09,
      234.57,
      214.43
    ],
    "text": "L.D.\u2014O. 24/2018",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      182.49,
      227.69,
      381.21,
      251.39
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE IMMIGRANTS AND EMIGRANTS ACT(CHAPTER 351)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.65,
      401.9,
      288.23
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      301.49,
      401.87,
      325.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Immigrants andEmigrants (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      338.45,
      401.89,
      362.03
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 14 of the Immigrants and Emigrants Act(Chapter 351) is hereby amended as follows:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      174.09,
      375.17,
      401.87,
      397.91
    ],
    "text": "(1) in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for thewords, \u201ctwo years,\u201d of the words \u201cfive years,\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      174.09,
      409.37,
      401.87,
      454.91
    ],
    "text": "(2) in subsection (2) thereof, by the substitution for thewords, \u201cexceeding two years but not exceeding fiveyears,\u201d of the words \u201cexceeding five years but notexceeding ten years,\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      174.09,
      466.37,
      401.88,
      489.11
    ],
    "text": "(3) by the insertion immediately after subsection (3)thereof, of the following subsection:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      190.89,
      500.57,
      401.89,
      546.11
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(3A) (a) Notwithstanding the time limitsspecified in subsections (1) and (2), the period ofpermanent residence visa may be determined by theMinister.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      190.89,
      557.57,
      401.86,
      591.71
    ],
    "text": "(b) for the purpose of paragraph (a), \u201cpermanentresidence visa\u201d means, a visa granted underregulations made under this Act.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      605.33,
      401.89,
      629.27
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
